1. 本科及以上學歷，商科/金融/傳媒相關專業優先；
2. 4年以上客戶服務/客戶關係相關經驗，金融行業或高淨值客戶服務經驗優先；
3. 高情商，形象氣質佳，性格外向、樂於社交，擅長建立人際關係，具備較強的圈層渗透與資源整合能力；
4. 對高淨值客戶服務、交易圈層社交有濃厚興趣與敏感度，擅長識別客戶深層需求、妥善處理客戶關係；
5. 溝通表達能力強，責任心強，服務意識佳；
6. 願配合平台打造個人IP形象，提升曝光與客戶觸達能力；
7. 能接受高強度工作節奏與頻繁出差/客戶拜訪；
8. 有個人才藝或興趣愛好（如高爾夫、紅酒品鑒等）者優先。

VIP Relationship Manager
Position Overview
Responsible for the maintenance and development of high-value clients, deeply cultivating VIP client relationships through offline visits, networking events, and other means to build long-term trust, driving continuous growth in key metrics such as trading volume, asset scale, and revenue. The role requires a strong sense of purpose, quick learning ability, and the capacity to adapt to high-intensity client visits and offline social networking activities.

Job Responsibilities
Provide timely and professional service support to VIP clients (high-net-worth individuals, professional traders), establishing and maintaining stable client relationships;
Take ownership of key KPIs for assigned clients—including asset scale, trading volume, and revenue contribution—achieving monthly/quarterly performance targets;
Deeply penetrate and cultivate VIP client circles through offline visits, client events, and social networking, building long-term trust-based relationships;
Quickly profile and identify high-potential target clients, establishing and maintaining a client lead pipeline and follow-up cadence;
Source and develop potential VIP clients and professional traders through multiple channels (offline visits, trading communities, industry networks, client referrals, etc.);
Keenly identify client needs and pain points, collaborating with product, operations, and other teams to provide tailored solutions for key clients.
Job Requirements
Bachelor's degree or above, preferably in business, finance, or media-related fields;
4+ years of experience in client service/client relationship management, preferably within the financial industry or high-net-worth client services;
High emotional intelligence, excellent presentation and demeanor, outgoing and sociable personality, skilled at building interpersonal relationships, with strong capabilities in network penetration and resource integration;
Strong interest and acumen for high-net-worth client services and trading community networking, skilled at identifying clients' underlying needs and effectively managing client relationships;
Excellent communication and expression skills, strong sense of responsibility, and outstanding customer service orientation;
Willing to collaborate with the platform to build a personal IP image, enhancing visibility and client outreach capabilities;
Able to handle a high-intensity work pace and frequent business travel/client visits;
Candidates with personal talents or hobbies (such as golf, wine tasting, etc.) are preferred.

